    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence1-11",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "元嘉十三年，東土饑，上遣揚州治中從事史沈演之巡行在所，演之上表曰：「宰邑敷政，必以簡惠成能，莅職闡治，務以利民著績。",
      "reading": "元嘉十三年東土饑，宋文帝遣沈演之巡行，沈奏言以簡惠利民衡縣宰。",
      "note": "元嘉十三年東土饑，宋文帝遣沈演之巡行，沈奏言以簡惠利民衡縣宰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 11,
      "end_codepoint": 69,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence1-69",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "故王奐見紀於前，叔卿流稱於後。",
      "reading": "奏引用王奐、叔卿兩古人。",
      "note": "奏引用王奐、叔卿兩古人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 69,
      "end_codepoint": 84,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence1-84",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "竊見錢唐令劉真道、餘杭令劉道錫，皆奉公卹民，恪勤匪懈，百姓稱詠，訟訴希簡。",
      "reading": "奏薦錢唐劉真道、餘杭劉道錫。",
      "note": "奏薦錢唐劉真道、餘杭劉道錫。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 84,
      "end_codepoint": 121,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence1-121",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "又翦蕩凶非，屢能擒獲。",
      "reading": "二人能清除凶害、捕獲犯罪。",
      "note": "二人能清除凶害、捕獲犯罪。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 121,
      "end_codepoint": 132,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence1-132",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "災水之初，餘杭高堤崩潰，洪流迅激，勢不可量，道錫躬先吏民，親執板築，塘既還立，縣邑獲全。",
      "reading": "餘杭堤潰時是劉道錫親執板築，保全一縣。",
      "note": "餘杭堤潰時是劉道錫親執板築，保全一縣。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 132,
      "end_codepoint": 176,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence1-176",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "經歷諸縣，訪覈名實，並為二邦之首最，治民之良宰。」",
      "reading": "演之以兩人為所巡各縣之首。",
      "note": "演之以兩人為所巡各縣之首。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 176,
      "end_codepoint": 201,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence1-201",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "上嘉之，各賜穀千斛，以真道為步兵校尉。",
      "reading": "文帝賜二人各穀千斛，真道為步兵校尉。",
      "note": "文帝賜二人各穀千斛，真道為步兵校尉。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p001",
