      "end_codepoint": 220,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "十四年，出為梁、南秦二州刺史。",
      "reading": "元嘉十四年任梁、南秦二州刺史。",
      "note": "元嘉十四年任梁、南秦二州刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 15,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence2-15",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "十八年，氐賊楊難當侵寇漢中，真道率軍討破之。",
      "reading": "十八年楊難當侵漢中，真道擊破。",
      "note": "十八年楊難當侵漢中，真道擊破。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 15,
      "end_codepoint": 37,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence2-37",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "而難當寇盜猶不已，太祖遣龍驤將軍裴方明率禁兵五千，受真道節度。",
      "reading": "宋文帝遣裴方明率五千禁兵受真道節度。",
      "note": "宋文帝遣裴方明率五千禁兵受真道節度。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 37,
      "end_codepoint": 68,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence2-68",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "十九年，方明至武興，率太子積弩將軍劉康祖、後軍參軍梁坦、陳彌、裴肅之、安西參軍段叔文、魯尚期、始興王國常侍劉僧秀、綏遠將軍馬洗、振武將軍王奐之等，進次潭谷，去蘭臯數里。",
      "reading": "十九年抵武興，方明率劉康祖等九人進潭谷，近蘭臯。",
      "note": "十九年抵武興，方明率劉康祖等九人進潭谷，近蘭臯。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 68,
      "end_codepoint": 152,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
