    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence2-200",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "方明進擊，大破之於濁水，斬弘祖并三千餘級。",
      "reading": "濁水戰方明斬苻弘祖及三千餘。",
      "note": "濁水戰方明斬苻弘祖及三千餘。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 200,
      "end_codepoint": 221,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence2-221",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "遣康祖追之，過蘭臯二千餘里。",
      "reading": "遣劉康祖追，文作過蘭臯二千餘里。",
      "note": "遣劉康祖追，文作過蘭臯二千餘里。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 221,
      "end_codepoint": 235,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence2-235",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "和又遣德義助戰，康祖又大破之，和退保脩城。",
      "reading": "和遣德義增援，康祖又破之，和退脩城。",
      "note": "和遣德義增援，康祖又破之，和退脩城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 235,
      "end_codepoint": 256,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence2-256",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "難當遣建忠將軍楊林、振威將軍姚憲領二千騎就和，方明又率諸將攻之，和敗走，追至赤亭，難當席卷奔叛。",
      "reading": "楊林、姚憲領二千騎赴和，失利退至赤亭，難當奔走。",
      "note": "楊林、姚憲領二千騎赴和，失利退至赤亭，難當奔走。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 256,
      "end_codepoint": 304,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence2-304",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "方明遣康祖直趣百頃，偽丞相楊萬壽等一時歸降。",
      "reading": "方明遣康祖趨百頃，楊萬壽等降。",
      "note": "方明遣康祖趨百頃，楊萬壽等降。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 304,
      "end_codepoint": 326,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence2-326",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "難當第三息虎先戍陰平，難當既走，虎逃竄民間，生禽之，送京都，斬于建康市。",
      "reading": "難當第三息虎守陰平後藏匿，被擒送京，在建康市被斬。",
      "note": "難當第三息虎守陰平後藏匿，被擒送京，在建康市被斬。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 326,
      "end_codepoint": 362,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "秦州刺史胡崇之西鎮百頃，行至濁水，為索虜所邀擊，敗沒。",
      "reading": "胡崇之鎮百頃至濁水遇北魏兵，敗沒。",
      "note": "胡崇之鎮百頃至濁水遇北魏兵，敗沒。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 27,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-27",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "以真道為建威將軍、雍州刺史，方明輔國將軍、梁南秦二州刺史。",
      "reading": "真道升建威將軍、雍州刺史，方明授輔國將軍、梁南秦刺史。",
      "note": "真道升建威將軍、雍州刺史，方明授輔國將軍、梁南秦刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 27,
      "end_codepoint": 56,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-56",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "方明辭不拜。",
      "reading": "方明辭不拜。",
      "note": "方明辭不拜。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 56,
      "end_codepoint": 62,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-62",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "詔曰：「往年氐豎楊難當造為叛亂，俛首者眾。",
      "reading": "宋文帝詔追述楊難當事。",
      "note": "宋文帝詔追述楊難當事。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 62,
      "end_codepoint": 83,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-83",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "其長史楊萬壽、建節將軍姚憲，情不違順，屢進矢言。",
      "reading": "詔稱楊萬壽與姚憲曾屢諫。",
      "note": "詔稱楊萬壽與姚憲曾屢諫。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 83,
      "end_codepoint": 107,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-107",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "及凶醜宵遁，闔境崩擾，建忠將軍呂訓衞倉儲以候王師。",
      "reading": "呂訓守倉以待宋軍。",
      "note": "呂訓守倉以待宋軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 107,
      "end_codepoint": 132,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-132",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "寧朔將軍姜檀果烈懇到，志在宣力，濁水之捷，厥庸顯然，近者協贊義奮，乃心無替。",
      "reading": "姜檀於濁水有功。",
      "note": "姜檀於濁水有功。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 132,
      "end_codepoint": 170,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-170",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "略陽苻昭，誠係本朝，亦同斯舉，俘擒偽將，獨克武興，推鋒致效，隕命寇手。",
      "reading": "苻昭獨克武興而死於寇手。",
      "note": "苻昭獨克武興而死於寇手。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 170,
      "end_codepoint": 205,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-205",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "並事著屯險，感于予懷，宜蒙旌敍，榮慰存亡。",
      "reading": "文帝欲旌恤生者與死者。",
      "note": "文帝欲旌恤生者與死者。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 205,
      "end_codepoint": 226,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-226",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "可贈萬壽龍驤將軍，昭武都太守，憲補員外散騎侍郎，訓駙馬都尉、奉朝請，檀征西大將軍司馬、仇池太守，宜並內徙。",
      "reading": "詔贈楊萬壽、苻昭，補授姚憲、呂訓、姜檀，令內徙。",
      "note": "詔贈楊萬壽、苻昭，補授姚憲、呂訓、姜檀，令內徙。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 226,
      "end_codepoint": 279,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence3-279",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "可符雍、梁二州，厚加贍卹。」",
      "reading": "令雍梁二州厚加贍卹。",
      "note": "令雍梁二州厚加贍卹。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 279,
      "end_codepoint": 293,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "dlx_8sg_2no",
      "source_quote": "真道、方明並坐破仇池，斷割金銀諸雜寶貨，又藏難當善馬，下獄死。",
      "reading": "真道、方明因侵取仇池金銀寶貨、藏難當馬而下獄死。",
      "note": "真道、方明因侵取仇池金銀寶貨、藏難當馬而下獄死。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-047-liuzhendao:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 31,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
